  dialogue:
  - Don't come in.
  - "I am bleeding everywhere \nand that damn dog can smell \nme dying."
  - Whatever you do, don't trust that mutt.
  - 'I can''t go on much longer, please

    take the key from my room and escape.'
  - Have you listened to the radio?
